xuqWAE-xYOvuI6NNJxIP4w&oe=69C3F160"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "1463017008351022", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618221_1463017011684355_8586765599955064393_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5kbBfiMON7sQ7kNvwHYYkH7&_nc_oc=AdrRS838XGDzSxelWyyGgLDxsbORSG34xA7Nd-fsriO18I2Fj4eJDBrviI75TvtLtD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxcwKnDhmwEDWBy2OZ8o6x9bfOn0swAm4LgjCmmJyktSA&oe=69C3D261"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Goalverse", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Goalverse is an immersive VR soccer game that transports players into a high-energy, futuristic world of competitive football. Designed for full-body interaction, players can run, kick, dive, and block using natural movements, delivering a physically engaging and adrenaline-pumping experience. Whether you're teaming up with friends in multiplayer matches or training solo to master precision and power, Goalverse offers fast-paced gameplay, reactive physics, and stunning arenas that push the boundaries of virtual sports. Step into the Goalverse and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes to dominate the pitch in a whole new dimension.\n", "short_description": "Goalverse is a fast-paced VR soccer game that throws you into the ultimate immersive football experience. Step into the cleats of a virtual athlete, master dynamic kicks, blocks, and dives, and compete in thrilling multiplayer matches across otherworldly arenas. Welcome to the universe where every goal counts \u2014 welcome to Goalverse.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Flixzy", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/goalverse/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Flixzy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/goalverse/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "